-- The desk merge (`doc/desk-merge-plan.md` §"Data model"): offices, zones,
-- hives, desks and their reservations, releases, grants and approval requests,
-- the employee-sync log and its settings singleton, and the new columns on
-- "User" and "ParkingSpot". Generated by `prisma migrate diff`; the
-- hand-written part is at the end and must survive any regeneration.
--
-- The Praha office, its zones and desks, and the office backfill are the next
-- migration (`20261112120200_praha_office`), generated from the floor plan.

